# Order Place redesign (Mother → Client)

Canonical spec: `docs/ORDER_PLACE_DESIGN_SPEC.md`

## Locked decisions
- **One** Order Place shell for Table / Collection / Delivery (not 3 pages).
- Keep separate entry: Visual Layout / Collection modal / Delivery modal.
- Mother first; Client later via **SharedUI**.
- Freeze send/void/pay/print/lifecycle behaviour while restyling.
- Payment moves to **bottom** action station; ~70/30 split; dual scroll only.

## SharedUI
- Extend `OrderWeb.SharedUI` (`CategoryButton` / `ProductButton` / `OrderEntryView` seeds exist).
- Prefer `Controls/OrderPlace/` or evolve existing controls — no parallel component set.
- Hosts own data/commands; SharedUI stays host-neutral.

